<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Physio-Control started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Physio-Control started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co said it initiated coverage of Physio-Control Inc as a long-term attractive.</p>
<p>-- said company is revamping its product platforms from seven to two, which should improve production efficiencies and gross margins going forward.</p>
<p>-- said company should see a &quot;significant acceleration&quot; in both sales and earnings in the fourth quarter of 1997 and throughout 1998.</p>
<p>-- said Physio-Control's alliance with Marquette Medical Systems Inc should add &quot;significantly&quot; to 1998 revenues and earnings per share.</p>
<p>-- Physio-Control lost 3/8 to 13-5/8.</p>
</text>
